Joystick: a ball moved with the joystick, fire changes the background.
VIC-20 BASIC V2, example 6 of BASICv2Quick.guide on the VIC, any RAM
expansion.

10 PRINT CHR$(147) : X=10 : Y=11
20 S=PEEK(648)*256 : C=37888+4*(PEEK(36866) AND 128)
30 P=22*Y+X : POKE S+P,81 : POKE C+P,2
40 J=PEEK(37137) : POKE 37154,127 : R=PEEK(37152) : POKE 37154,255
50 IF (J AND 60)=60 AND (R AND 128)=128 THEN 40
60 POKE S+P,32
70 IF (J AND 4)=0 AND Y>0 THEN Y=Y-1
80 IF (J AND 8)=0 AND Y<22 THEN Y=Y+1
90 IF (J AND 16)=0 AND X>0 THEN X=X-1
100 IF (R AND 128)=0 AND X<21 THEN X=X+1
110 IF (J AND 32)=0 THEN POKE 36879,(PEEK(36879)+16) AND 255
120 FOR D=1 TO 30 : NEXT D
130 GOTO 30
